//@version=6
//==============================================================================
// 🔱 AETHER FLOW SYSTEM – (Skyliner.jojo OB Edition)
//==============================================================================
//
// 🔰 DESCRIPTION:
// AETHER FLOW SYSTEM is a fully integrated Smart Money Concept and Hybrid 
// Market Structure Engine that merges institutional order flow analytics with 
// dynamic liquidity mapping. Designed for professional traders seeking 
// structure clarity and precision reversal timing.
//
// 💡 Core Frameworks:
//   • Mxwll Suite (Market Structure + Auto Fibs + CHoCH/BOS Detection)
//   • UT Bot System (Adaptive ATR-based Trend Shifts) + Label Management ⭐
//   • Hull Suite Engine (Trend Velocity & Momentum Filtering)
//   • LuxAlgo-Inspired FVG Engine (Mitigation and Unmitigated Zones)
//   • LuxAlgo Order Blocks (Volume Pivot Detection) ⭐ NEW
//   • Three-Bar Reversal Pattern Recognition (Trend-Filtered Confirmations)
//   • Real-Time Session Heatmap & Volume Activity Dashboard
//   • SMC Confluence Signal Engine -- fuses Structure Bias, Hull Trend,
//     Order Block zones and FVG/liquidity zones around a single reversal
//     trigger into one scored Buy/Sell signal ⭐ NEW
//
// 🧭 System Philosophy:
//   "See the unseen liquidity. Trade the rhythm of price flow."
//
// 🔗 HOW THE FRAMEWORKS ARE FUSED:
//   Each framework above still runs and displays independently (structure
//   labels, Hull trend line, FVG/OB zones, 3-Bar patterns, momentum phases)
//   so nothing that worked before is removed. On top of that, the
//   Confluence Signal Engine (bottom of the script) reads the live state of
//   all of them -- external BOS/CHoCH bias, Hull trend direction, whether
//   price sits inside the most recent Order Block, whether price sits
//   inside the most recent unmitigated FVG -- and scores how many agree
//   with a chosen reversal trigger (UT Bot / 3-Bar Reversal / Momentum
//   Phase / Any). Only when the trigger fires AND enough of those factors
//   line up does it print a single BUY/SELL confluence label + alert(),
//   with a small dashboard showing exactly which factors agreed.
//
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 📁 CATEGORY:
//   - Smart Money Concepts
//   - Market Structure & Volume
//   - Liquidity Mapping / Order Flow
//   - Multi-Framework Hybrid Systems
//
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// ⚠️ DISCLAIMER:
// This indicator is for educational and analytical purposes only. 
// It is not intended as financial advice. Trading carries risk.
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Developed with ❤️ by Skyliner.jojo
//==============================================================================

indicator("🔱 SMC Flow System – v2",overlay=true,
     max_labels_count=500, max_lines_count=500, max_boxes_count=500, max_bars_back=500)

