// ============================================
// SMC CONFLUENCE SIGNAL ENGINE INPUTS
// ============================================
// Three independently-labeled signal sources share this group: UT Bot (its
// own native Buy/Sell labels, unchanged), an EMA 14/60 cross signal, and the
// SMC confluence signal. The SMC signal always requires Structure (BOS/CHoCH)
// bias to agree, plus at least ONE of three alternative recipes:
//   Recipe A: Liquidity zone   -- Order Block OR Demand/Supply zone
//   Recipe B: FVG + Demand/Supply zone together
//   Recipe C: Fibonacci golden zone (0.618-0.786 retracement)
